Output helix.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Shell zsh

Hide
Type "source ~/.zshrc 2>/dev/null; clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "cd ~/code/clutchdata/frontend && hx ."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Space
Type "f"
Sleep 600ms
Type "cookies"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s

Space
Type "s"
Sleep 600ms
Type "sections"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "ma("
Sleep 2s

Type "y"
Sleep 1s

Type ":w"
Enter
Sleep 2s
